OL,3,GNEWSAMajor blow for #90m road scheme
OL,4,
OL,5,FPlans to upgrade part of the A500
OL,6,Fbetween Crewe and the M6 have been
OL,7,Fdealt a major blow after the government
OL,8,Fconfirmed it will not fund the #90m
OL,9,Froad scheme.
OL,11,FThe project would have turned part of
OL,12,Fthe route into a dual carriageway, but
OL,13,FCheshire East Council said it had now
OL,14,Fbeen removed from the government's
OL,15,Fmajor road network programme.
OL,17,FCouncil leaders described the decision
OL,18,Fas "deeply disappointing" and warned a
OL,19,Fsignificant opportunity to support
OL,20,FCrewe's future growth had been lost.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
